MTD	title	Uniquely Tumor-Selective Englerin A Profoundly Alters Lipid Metabolism in Renal Cell Carcinoma inducing ER-Stress and an Acute Inflammatory Response
MTD	description	This targeted metabolomic analysis was performed on renal cell carcinoma A498 cells with or without anti-cancer drug Englerin treatment for 24 and 48 h.
